In summary, the problem of determining whether a graph $G$ contains a subgraph of weight $k$ is a complex problem that can be solved using a variety of algorithms and techniques. The choice of algorithm will depend on the specific characteristics of the graph and the value of $k$, and may involve a trade-off between efficiency and optimality.

